    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>Tiredness of the first week has passed</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No wheeze or breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>Four migraine attacks in four weeks; no new features</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Right wrist stiff and sore after long writing</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

